item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_tear.name=Arcane Tunnel
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_tear.name_linked=Linked Arcane Tunnel
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_tear.lore=§dPulls the arcane threads between places to open a temporary tunnel between them. Attune to a destination to open a rift back to that point.
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_tear.unbound=§7Unbound. Right-click in air to mark this place.
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_tear.bound=Bound: %d, %d, %d (dim %d)
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_tear.shift=Sneak-use unbinds. Air-use attunes this place (unbound) or opens a 60s rift at the bound point (linked). Standing pets and leads follow; sitting pets stay.
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_tear.shift_hint=§8Hold Shift for details.
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_tear.attuned=§5[Arcana]§r §dAttuned Arcane Tunnel to X: %d, Y: %d, Z: %d.
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_tear.cleared=§5[Arcana]§r §7Cleared Arcane Tunnel attunement.
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_tear.failed=§5[Arcana]§r The rift failed to open.
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_tear.missing_dim=§5[Arcana]§r The bound dimension is not loaded.
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_wild.name=Unstable Arcane Tunnel
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_wild.lore=§dDistorts arcane energy to open a tunnel between the current location and another random point in the same dimension.
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_wild.shift=§8Air-use opens a red rift pair 4000-6000 blocks away. Standing pets and leads follow; sitting pets stay.
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_wild.shift_hint=§8Hold Shift for details.
item.aqtweaks.spatial_rift_wild.no_land=§5[Arcana]§r No safe land was found.
entity.arcane_rift.name=Arcane Rift
entity.deep_dwarf.name=Deep Dwarf
effect.aqtweaks.homestead=Homestead
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.melee_efficiency=Melee Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.melee_efficiency.desc=Melee attacks cost 1 less stamina. Light attacks may be free.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.ranged_efficiency=Ranged Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.ranged_efficiency.desc=Bows cost 1 to draw and drain hold stamina more slowly. Thrown weapons use the same hold rules.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.shield_efficiency=Shield Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.shield_efficiency.desc=Raised shields drain stamina half as often.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.adrenaline=Adrenaline
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.adrenaline.desc=Taking damage while below 3 stamina restores you to 20. 20 second cooldown.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.expert_climber=Expert Climber
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.expert_climber.desc=Climbing, clinging, ledges, and grappling cost 1 less stamina.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cardio_master=Cardio Master
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cardio_master.desc=Jumping and sprinting cost 1 less stamina.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_expert=Mining Expert
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_expert.desc=Your pickaxes harvest as if they were diamond tier. Speed and durability still come from the tool.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.evasion=Evasion
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.evasion.desc=Spend dodge stamina to cancel a hit from a living attacker. 30 second cooldown.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.respite=Respite
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.respite.desc=Once per minute, a lethal hit leaves you standing with Regeneration II and defence for 5 seconds. Does not save you from the void.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.power_attack=Power Attack
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.power_attack.desc=A full stamina bar empowers medium and heavy melee hits for extra damage and extra stamina cost.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.armor_mastery=Armor Mastery
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.armor_mastery.desc=Reduces the weight of all worn armor pieces by 1 half-feather.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_efficiency=Mining Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_efficiency.desc=Reduces the stamina cost of all mining actions by 1 half-feather.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.precision_shot=Precision Shot
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.precision_shot.desc=A fully drawn bow shot deals double damage.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herbalist=Herbalist
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herbalist.desc=Always harvest one extra from magic-mod plants.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.gathering_efficiency=Gathering Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.gathering_efficiency.desc=Forage breaks cost 1 less stamina. Does not affect mining, shearing, or fishing.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.bountiful_harvest=Bountiful Harvest
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.bountiful_harvest.desc=Mature food crops always drop one extra. Not melons, pumpkins, or magic-mod herbs.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.rancher=Rancher
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.rancher.desc=Tended animals nearby grow, breed, drink, and produce faster. Milk still costs a bucket.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.drafter=Drafter
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.drafter.desc=Unlocks Effortless Building lines, walls, floors, and diagonals.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sculptor=Sculptor
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sculptor.desc=Unlocks Effortless Building circles, cylinders, spheres, and cubes.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.transpose=Transpose
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.transpose.desc=Unlocks Effortless Building quick replace.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.vis_thrift=Vis Thrift
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.vis_thrift.desc=Foci and the Arcane Workbench spend 30% less vis.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.quiet_mind=Quiet Mind
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.quiet_mind.desc=Warp incidents are milder. Some fail to take hold at all.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.glass_cutter=Glass Cutter
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.glass_cutter.desc=Breaking glass and panes drops the block instead of shards of nothing.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herd_abundance=Herd Abundance
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herd_abundance.desc=Shearing Animania sheep or goats yields extra breed wool. Empty-hand nest collection yields an extra egg.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.iron_gut=Iron Gut
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.iron_gut.desc=Pack alcohols no longer apply their over-drink effect. Thirst and quality still apply.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.water_collector=Water Collector
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.water_collector.desc=Bottles and canteens filled from world water are purified. Drinking from a source skips Thirsty and parasites.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.full_font=Full Font
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.full_font.desc=Casting a focus from a nearly full aura costs more vis and empowers the next spell.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.blood_pact=Blood Pact
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.blood_pact.desc=Lose four hearts. Classified magic you deal is doubled.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.druid=Druid
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.druid.desc=Mana costs 30% less. Generating flowers near you make 15% more mana. Locks you to this school.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mana_veil=Mana Veil
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mana_veil.desc=Spend mana to absorb 20% of a hit (1000 mana per heart point).
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.living_edge=Living Edge
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.living_edge.desc=Botania weapons and bursts deal 15% more damage.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.witch=Witch
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.witch.desc=Rituals drain 30% less power. Nearby altars gain 15% more from decorations. Locks you to this school.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cold_iron_mind=Cold Iron Mind
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cold_iron_mind.desc=Warp from finishing a ritual is halved, type by type, rounding down.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.stitch=Stitch
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.stitch.desc=Poppets survive one extra hit. Repair any poppet with witches stitching.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.astromancer=Astromancer
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.astromancer.desc=Altar crafts spend 30% less starlight and finish 25% faster. Locks you to this school.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.astral_warmth=Astral Warmth
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.astral_warmth.desc=Your body temperature cannot fall below 9.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.star_powered=Star Powered
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.star_powered.desc=Under open night sky, you deal 25% more damage and keep Regeneration and feather replenishment.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.artificer=Artificer
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.artificer.desc=Ember costs 30% less. Nearby stampers, mixers, and melters run 25% faster. Locks you to this school.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.live_spark=Live Spark
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.live_spark.desc=Ember attacks deal 20% more damage after Magic skill bonuses.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cinder_ward=Cinder Ward
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cinder_ward.desc=Body heat cannot rise above 15. Fire hits deal 20% less, or heal you if you already have fire resistance.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.benevolent=Benevolent
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.benevolent.desc=Healing another living creature restores twice as much. Healing yourself is unchanged.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.dark_vision=Dark Vision
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.dark_vision.desc=Dim light brightens on your screen, less than a Night Vision potion, and fades out as the area gets brighter.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.spelunker=Spelunker
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.spelunker.desc=Underground, deep and shallow warp fill at half rate, and your body temperature moves toward comfort.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.tunnel_sense=Tunnel Sense
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.tunnel_sense.desc=A nearby hostile pings and glows for 5 seconds. The sense waits until that glow ends.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.prospector=Prospector
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.prospector.desc=Improves usage of Prospecting Pick by outlining detected ores. Better quality picks will more accurately detect ores.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.motherlode=Motherlode
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.motherlode.desc=Ore breaks can add one extra ore. The chance grows with Mining.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.lithomancy=Lithomancy
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.lithomancy.desc=Any ore can drop a Rare Earth. The chance grows with Mining. Silk Touch blocks it.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.stone_cleaver=Stone Cleaver
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.stone_cleaver.desc=Diamond-tier picks and better lose no durability on stone, cobble, or gravel.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.lumberjack=Lumberjack
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.lumberjack.desc=Log breaks can add one extra log. The chance grows with Gathering.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.reforester=Reforester
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.reforester.desc=Leaves drop one sapling of that tree. Shears and Silk Touch still take the leaf.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sifter=Sifter
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sifter.desc=Gravel keeps its gravel and can add flint. Clay can add a clay ball. The chance grows with Gathering.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.wood_splitter=Wood Splitter
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.wood_splitter.desc=Diamond-tier axes and better lose no durability on logs.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.orchard=Orchard
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.orchard.desc=Melons, pumpkins, and ripe tree fruit can drop one extra. The chance grows with Farming.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sower=Sower
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sower.desc=Right-click farmland to plant a 3 by 3, one seed per block.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.husbandry=Husbandry
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.husbandry.desc=Babies within 16 blocks grow up faster and can breed again sooner.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.hearty_meal=Hearty Meal
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.hearty_meal.desc=Food restores 2 extra hunger.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.seed_harvester=Seed Harvester
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.seed_harvester.desc=Mature crops can drop one extra seed. The chance grows with Farming.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.finisher=Finisher
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.finisher.desc=Melee hits deal 50% more damage to a mob below one quarter health.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.aura_breaker=Aura Breaker
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.aura_breaker.desc=Melee hits apply Broken Magic Shield III for 5 seconds.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.bleeding_edge=Bleeding Edge
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.bleeding_edge.desc=Melee hits apply bleeding for 16 seconds. The target takes damage while it moves.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.pinning_shot=Pinning Shot
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.pinning_shot.desc=Physical ranged hits apply Slowness II for 2 seconds.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.opportunistic=Opportunistic
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.opportunistic.desc=Melee against a target another creature hit in the last 3 seconds uses your stealth attack.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.fortify=Fortify
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.fortify.desc=A raised shield costs no stamina. Standing still while blocking grants Resistance II.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.unyielding=Unyielding
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.unyielding.desc=A raised shield gives full knockback resistance, including hits outside the block arc.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.awareness=Awareness
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.awareness.desc=You do not take extra damage from a stealth melee hit.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.fast_revive=Fast Revive
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.fast_revive.desc=You count as two helpers while reviving another player.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.taunt=Taunt
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.taunt.desc=You generate twice as much threat. Locks out Low Profile.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.low_profile=Low Profile
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.low_profile.desc=You generate three quarters as much threat. Locks out Taunt.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.soft_step=Soft Step
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.soft_step.desc=You do not trample crops.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.tumble=Tumble
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.tumble.desc=Fall damage is halved. The void is unchanged.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.slow_fall=Slow Fall
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.slow_fall.desc=Falling beside a solid wall slows your fall. Open shafts do not.
